description	"Jedi Traditionalist

A disciplined master well-studied in jedi literature, limited speed, defense and force capability in favor of devastating form. Swings, specials, and deflects deal increased damage.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Lightsaber (Red)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (1)
-- Saber Deflect (3)
--- 1.66x more damage (500)
--- 2x deflect damage
--- 2x special damage
-- EX Saber Throw (2) ^3[CS1]
--- 1.5x damage (50)
-- Slap ^3[CS2]

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (3)
- Sense (3)

^8Attributes:
- Healing (1)
- Force Block (2)
- Force Focus (2)
- 40% slower skill cooldown"